SHA256: 1fbfae4eaaafc62c66a298e63e16fc5211566e1e3de1c58f83c35c6bc226c9f9
The repository declares Apache-2.0. The recommended v5 is selected instead
of experimental v6. Native adapter tensors retain alpha/rank=1: rank 192 for
q/k/v projections and rank 64 for output/FFN projections.

HQ v5 uses two reference paths: normalized VAE latents and image features
inside the chat-templated text input. The latter follows the published
ai-toolkit training contract (Picture N markers, image placeholders and
multimodal rotary positions), not the latent-only chinoll edit contract:
https://github.com/ostris/ai-toolkit/tree/main/extensions_built_in/diffusion_models/moss_image
The existing bundled Apache-2.0 Qwen3.5 model implementation is reused.
